===Etymology===
Short for {{m|en|supersonic}} {{m|en|combustion}} {{m|en|ramjet}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|aeronautics}} A [[jet engine]] capable of propelling an [[aircraft]] at [[hypersonic]] speeds, in which [[combustion]] of the [[fuel]]/[[air]] mixture occurs at [[supersonic]] speeds.
# An aircraft that uses such an engine.

